WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:01.940
CONDITION.

00:00:00.372 --> 00:00:04.309
SHE REPORTEDLY WAS UPSET OVER

00:00:02.073 --> 00:00:07.646
YOUTUBE POLICY, SHE SAID WERE

00:00:04.442 --> 00:00:09.614
SUPPRESSING SOME OF HER VIDEOS.

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:11.283
IN A LITTLE LESS THAN AN HOUR,

00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:13.051
BELLS WILL TOLL, FIRST IN

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:15.520
MEMPHIS AND THEN AROUND THE

00:00:13.184 --> 00:00:16.254
WORLD TO MARK THE 50TH

00:00:15.654 --> 00:00:17.789
ANNIVERSARY OF THE ASSASSINATION

00:00:16.388 --> 00:00:22.260
OF MARTIN LUTHER KING JR.

00:00:17.923 --> 00:00:24.496
CORRESPONDENT JONATHAN SERRIE

00:00:22.394 --> 00:00:27.432
REPORTS ON THE OBSERVANCES FROM

00:00:24.629 --> 00:00:28.800
MEMPHIS.

00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:31.236
&gt;&gt; THOUSANDS GATHERED IN MEMPHIS

00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:31.970
TO COMMEMORATE THE 50TH

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:36.474
ANNIVERSARY OF THE ASSASSINATION

00:00:32.103 --> 00:00:39.678
OF DR. MARTIN LUTHER KING JR.

00:00:36.608 --> 00:00:41.146
&gt;&gt; WHEN I WAS 16 YEARS OF AGE,

00:00:39.811 --> 00:00:41.646
THAT MAN TOUCHED MY LIFE AND

00:00:41.279 --> 00:00:46.785
DIRECTED MY PATH.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:47.986
TODAY, I AM EXHILARATING VOICES

00:00:46.918 --> 00:00:48.687
OF YOUNG PEOPLE AROUND THE

00:00:48.119 --> 00:00:49.454
UNITED STATES OF AMERICA, WHO

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.823
ARE AGAIN USING THE SAME THING

00:00:49.588 --> 00:00:55.060
THAT I FELT.

00:00:51.957 --> 00:00:57.329
&gt;&gt; ON APRIL 3RD, 1968, KING AND

00:00:55.193 --> 00:00:58.096
HIS ENTOURAGE CAME TO MEMPHIS TO

00:00:57.462 --> 00:00:58.897
SUPPORT STRIKING SANITATION

00:00:58.229 --> 00:01:00.899
WORKERS.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:02.467
HE RALLIED THEM WITH HIS "I'VE

00:01:01.032 --> 00:01:04.069
BEEN TO THE MOUNTAINTOP" SPEECH.

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:06.271
THE FOLLOWING EVENING, THE CIVIL

00:01:04.202 --> 00:01:07.439
RIGHTS LEADER AND FORMER U.N.

00:01:06.404 --> 00:01:08.173
AMBASSADOR ANDREW YOUNG

00:01:07.572 --> 00:01:08.974
REMEMBERS JOKING AROUND WITH

00:01:08.306 --> 00:01:11.977
KING BACK AT THE MOTEL.

00:01:09.107 --> 00:01:14.379
&gt;&gt; I SAID SOMETHING SMART AND HE

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:14.746
PICKED UP A PILL AND THREW IT AT

00:01:14.512 --> 00:01:15.880
ME.

00:01:14.879 --> 00:01:18.350
AND I THREW IT BACK AND THEN

00:01:16.014 --> 00:01:18.917
EVERYBODY PICKED UP PILLOWS AND

00:01:18.483 --> 00:01:22.420
STARTED BEATING ME UP.

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:24.055
AND IT WAS LIKE, THIS IS THE

00:01:22.554 --> 00:01:25.590
HAPPIEST MOMENT I HAD SEEN.

00:01:24.189 --> 00:01:28.727
&gt;&gt; MOMENTS LATER, KING STEPPED

00:01:25.724 --> 00:01:29.661
ONTO THE BALCONY OUTSIDE ROOM

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:31.630
306 OF THE LORRAINE MOTEL WHEN A

00:01:29.794 --> 00:01:32.397
SHOT FIRED FROM A WINDOW OF A

00:01:31.763 --> 00:01:32.664
BOARDINGHOUSE ACROSS THE STREET

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:37.969
TO.

00:01:32.797 --> 00:01:42.507
&gt;&gt; SAW HIS SHOES STUCK IN THE

00:01:38.103 --> 00:01:45.410
GREAT AND I RAN UP THE STEPS AND

00:01:42.641 --> 00:01:46.645
REALIZED THAT HE HAD BEEN SHOT

00:01:45.543 --> 00:01:48.113
AND THAT HE WAS LAYING THERE IN

00:01:46.778 --> 00:01:49.447
A PUDDLE OF BLOOD.

00:01:48.246 --> 00:01:50.215
&gt;&gt; THE SITE OF KING'S

00:01:49.581 --> 00:01:51.316
ASSASSINATION IS NOT PRESERVED

00:01:50.348 --> 00:01:53.685
AS PART OF THE NATIONAL CIVIL

00:01:52.884 --> 00:01:58.556
RIGHTS MUSEUM.

00:01:53.818 --> 00:02:02.060
&gt;&gt; HE CAPTURED THE HUMAN

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:02.627
PREDICAMENT IN A WAY THAT FEW

00:02:02.193 --> 00:02:04.796
ARE ABLE TO CAPTURE.

00:02:02.761 --> 00:02:06.331
&gt;&gt; KING'S YOUNGEST DAUGHTER,

00:02:04.929 --> 00:02:07.666
BERNICE, TO WORD A NEW EXHIBIT

00:02:06.464 --> 00:02:08.833
HONORING HER FATHER'S LIFE.

00:02:07.799 --> 00:02:10.268
AS OF MONDAY, SHE COMES TO THIS

00:02:08.967 --> 00:02:12.671
PLACE NOT JUST TO REMEMBER WHAT

00:02:10.402 --> 00:02:14.272
HAPPENED HALF A CENTURY AGO,

00:02:12.804 --> 00:02:15.907
BUT TO CELEBRATE THE ENDURING

00:02:14.406 --> 00:02:16.775
IMPACT KING CONTINUES TO HAVE ON

00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:19.778
AMERICAN SOCIETY.

00:02:16.908 --> 00:02:23.081
&gt;&gt; HE LEFT US WITH A BLUEPRINT

00:02:19.911 --> 00:02:25.250
FOR MOVING FORWARD.

00:02:24.582 --> 00:02:28.053
&gt;&gt; CHRIS, THE NATIONAL CIVIL

00:02:25.383 --> 00:02:29.688
RIGHTS MUSEUM IS GOING TO MARK

00:02:28.186 --> 00:02:31.489
THE MOMENT KING WAS

00:02:29.821 --> 00:02:33.191
ASSASSINATED, 6:01:00 P.M.

00:02:31.623 --> 00:02:34.492
CENTRAL TIME, BY RINGING A BELL

00:02:33.324 --> 00:02:36.528
AND THEN ENTER GO MINUTE

00:02:34.626 --> 00:02:38.663
INCREMENTS, BELLS WILL BEGIN TO

00:02:36.661 --> 00:02:39.864
TOLL THROUGHOUT THE CITY OF

00:02:38.797 --> 00:02:42.067
MEMPHIS AND THEN NATIONALLY AND

00:02:39.998 --> 00:02:42.367
THEN AROUND THE WORLD.

